Third-party data in src/proseweave/data/
========================================

synonyms_en.bin.gz
    Noun and verb synonym sets built from Princeton WordNet 3.0 (via NLTK's
    copy of the database): for each single-word lemma, the other single-word
    lemmas of the synsets it belongs to, stored as (lemma, synonym) pairs in
    proseweave's packed table format (tools/pack_tables.py). WordNet licence
    below.

lemma_en.json.gz, lemma_index_en.bin.gz
    English lemmatizer tables (rules and exceptions; the index of known lemmas
    per word class, packed by tools/pack_tables.py) extracted from spaCy's
    en_core_web_sm 3.7.1, which is distributed under the MIT licence (below).
    The tables themselves derive from WordNet 3.0:

        WordNet 3.0 Copyright 2006 by Princeton University. All rights reserved.

